From 288e9f8f31eb4b8b27e483331613c989f1654b6d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:41:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Show how good the ground is for fields when placing a village

Tapping a spot for Move village, Build a village or Found a daughter village now marks it; the pick bar says how good the ground is for fields (and, for a move, what the harvest would be against the present fields) and 'Build here' does the deed. The result card of a move and of a new farming village carries the same line. No rule changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019wRbtUYJu7HQtFV5w2A4YS
